After a long time away, I started a Nethack game. My Valkyrie found a
co-aligned altar on the 2d level, and a bunch of nickel and dime
sacrifices yielded Mjollnir. I've hit the Medusa level, but retreated
after a gray dragon left scales. A magic lamp got me a tame djinn; a
polymorph trap turned my djinn and cat into a vampire lord and
nalfeshnee.

