have one leash on me. Soon I expect to have the Orb of Fate; will a
leash keep a pet with me during a levelport? Is it the only thing that
will? Is keeping both a vampire lord and nalfeshnee with me worth
hunting through the whole dungeon for the other leash I know is out
there somewhere (especially when I'm a pretty tough fighter alone)?

I've got Int 7 and Wis 12. My original +3 shield is my only metal
armor, but I'm also usually wielding Mjollnir or Frost Brand. I've got
an amulet of reflection, but I figured if the dungeon yielded a shield
of reflection, I'd take that and leave the amulet slot for life-saving
(which I haven't found yet.) I have a large stack of spellbooks, a
couple of which are blessed, and I could bless the rest if I tried.
Would it be worth even trying to be a spellcaster?

